  "reasoning": "The defendant, Zhao, used his position to fabricate false bank deposit certificates, deceived the bank and depositors, and withdrew the deposited funds for personal use. The conduct meets the elements of fraud (诈骗罪): illegal acquisition of property by deception, with a particularly large amount (over 1 million yuan). The prosecution’s argument that it is not misappropriation of funds is supported by the fact that Zhao was not a bank employee, so the crime of misappropriation of funds does not apply. Therefore the appropriate charge, as reflected in the example labels, is the generic fraud charge \"诈骗\".",
  "final_answer": "诈骗"
}
